WEBVTT

01:36.240 --> 01:41.020
[The Journey of Legend]

01:41.340 --> 01:43.920
[Episode 18]

01:45.280 --> 01:45.930
Qiushui!

01:53.090 --> 01:53.680
Qiushui!

02:05.540 --> 02:06.430
Xiao Qiushui!

02:12.190 --> 02:13.910
Aren't you afraid of death?

02:14.750 --> 02:17.079
The Power Gang destroyed our Xiao family.

02:18.170 --> 02:20.100
So what does death matter to me now?

02:20.280 --> 02:21.160
Xiao Qiushui.

02:22.070 --> 02:24.130
I know you're desperate for revenge,

02:24.260 --> 02:25.820
but in your current condition,

02:25.820 --> 02:27.470
you're no match for them.

02:27.660 --> 02:29.120
Even if it costs me my life,

02:30.540 --> 02:32.340
I won't let them get away with it.

02:35.550 --> 02:37.000
If we lend you our power,

02:37.940 --> 02:40.590
you might stand a chance against them.

02:41.190 --> 02:43.540
Unfortunately, we've been infected with
worm poison.

02:43.540 --> 02:44.950
If we transfer our power to you,

02:44.950 --> 02:46.260
I'm afraid it would harm you.

02:46.260 --> 02:47.140
Indeed,

02:47.140 --> 02:49.540
and you'd be infected with
worm poison too.

02:56.350 --> 02:57.070
Seniors.

02:57.620 --> 02:59.420
I'm already a worthless person.

03:00.790 --> 03:02.230
Even if I'm poisoned,

03:02.860 --> 03:04.790
what difference does it make to me?

03:05.310 --> 03:06.140
But Qiushui,

03:06.820 --> 03:08.880
once our power's unleashed upon you,

03:09.790 --> 03:12.980
the agony will be as if your bones
are crushed and your tendons torn.

03:12.980 --> 03:14.710
As long as I can have my revenge,

03:16.100 --> 03:17.190
I fear not death!

03:17.630 --> 03:18.690
I beg you, Seniors,

03:18.980 --> 03:21.310
please impart your internal energy to me!

03:24.380 --> 03:25.579
-Alright.
-Alright.

03:37.590 --> 03:39.570
♪ Let this long river boil and burn ♪

03:39.590 --> 03:42.090
♪ Reforge new mountains and seas ♪

03:42.110 --> 03:45.710
♪ Let the gleam of swords
cut through all dust ♪

03:45.910 --> 03:47.870
♪ Strive for the far shore
at journey's end ♪

03:47.890 --> 03:49.910
♪ Only when the long night
finally comes to an end ♪

03:49.930 --> 03:52.960
♪ Will this bow be not in vain ♪

03:52.990 --> 03:55.230
♪ Let this long river boil and burn ♪

03:55.260 --> 03:57.170
♪ Reforge new mountains and seas ♪

03:57.200 --> 04:00.430
♪ Let the gleam of swords
cut through all dust ♪

04:00.890 --> 04:02.360
♪ Strive for the far shore
at journey's end ♪

04:02.390 --> 04:04.360
♪ Only when the long night
finally comes to an end ♪

04:04.390 --> 04:07.590
♪ Will this bow be not in vain ♪

04:07.620 --> 04:09.730
♪ Let the pouring rain drench me ♪

04:09.760 --> 04:11.480
♪ Let frost and snow embrace me too ♪

04:11.500 --> 04:14.970
♪ My lifelong sword intent
remains unchanged ♪

04:15.000 --> 04:16.720
♪ Through 1,000 years, a million ages ♪

04:16.750 --> 04:18.730
♪ I will still cleave mountains
and carve paths ♪

04:18.750 --> 04:25.650
♪ Waiting for the fog to clear,
waiting for the dawn and you to come ♪

05:10.790 --> 05:11.920
What a useless fool.

05:24.420 --> 05:26.880
Borrowing someone else's internal energy.

05:27.160 --> 05:27.960
Interesting.

05:37.590 --> 05:38.920
Father's jade pendant?

05:40.230 --> 05:43.310
Father once said that while
the jade pendant exists, the person lives;

05:43.310 --> 05:45.770
if the pendant is lost,
the person perishes.

05:47.190 --> 05:48.990
Could Father and Mother have...

05:55.140 --> 05:56.190
Liu Suifeng.

06:00.070 --> 06:01.270
Where are my parents?

06:06.960 --> 06:08.350
Where are my parents!

06:15.850 --> 06:17.090
Liu Suifeng.

06:18.650 --> 06:20.360
Today is your day to die!

06:23.780 --> 06:25.840
This kid has incredible resilience.

06:26.430 --> 06:28.550
Our utterly different types of
internal energy

06:28.550 --> 06:30.080
actually flowed through his meridians

06:30.080 --> 06:31.450
with barely a hitch.

06:32.290 --> 06:33.530
If he survives today,

06:33.990 --> 06:35.850
his potential will be limitless.

06:35.870 --> 06:36.510
Indeed.

06:45.820 --> 06:46.550
Tianzheng.

06:47.020 --> 06:50.080
This kid doesn't seem to be affected
by the worm poison.

06:52.159 --> 06:54.890
Xiao Qiushui originally had
no internal energy.

06:55.050 --> 06:57.780
Where would the poison worms
attach themselves?

07:19.430 --> 07:22.970
Liu Suifeng endangers the martial world
and causes endless trouble.

07:22.970 --> 07:24.900
We absolutely cannot let him live.

07:59.510 --> 08:00.110
Master!

08:06.110 --> 08:07.340
Master! Master!

08:07.820 --> 08:08.630
Longhu.

08:09.310 --> 08:10.260
Why did you...

08:11.900 --> 08:12.670
Master.

08:13.310 --> 08:14.780
I can never repay

08:15.550 --> 08:16.880
your years of guidance.

08:17.630 --> 08:19.510
But the Power Gang saved my life,

08:20.430 --> 08:22.140
and I must repay that debt.

08:22.700 --> 08:23.460
Longhu!

08:24.110 --> 08:25.220
I'll kill you!

08:25.220 --> 08:25.950
Baoxiang.

08:26.820 --> 08:27.550
Forget it.

08:28.430 --> 08:28.900
Master.

08:28.900 --> 08:31.550
He was your senior for many years
after all.

08:32.539 --> 08:35.059
It's not your place to punish him.

08:35.580 --> 08:36.429
Master...

08:37.669 --> 08:38.390
Longhu.

08:39.460 --> 08:42.789
After today, do you consider
that life-saving debt repaid?

08:45.790 --> 08:46.460
Yes.

08:47.700 --> 08:48.740
That's good then.

08:50.430 --> 08:51.820
Life and death aside,

08:52.660 --> 08:54.720
with all debts and grudges resolved,

08:54.740 --> 08:58.340
your inner demon can finally
be laid to rest.

09:14.950 --> 09:15.580
Today,

09:16.550 --> 09:18.670
I've repaid all my debts.

09:19.390 --> 09:20.150
And now,

09:20.700 --> 09:22.580
I'll repay what I owe you, Master!

09:40.000 --> 09:41.720
Such a tragic fate.

09:43.460 --> 09:45.860
Amitabha.

09:58.400 --> 09:59.690
-Master!
-Master!

10:02.820 --> 10:03.700
Senior!

10:23.220 --> 10:23.910
Master!

10:35.450 --> 10:36.540
[Calm and Composed]

11:07.030 --> 11:08.390
S-Senior.

11:12.100 --> 11:13.550
How could this be?

11:14.140 --> 11:19.100
Who would have thought that
even Leader Mo of Hengshan Sect

11:20.860 --> 11:22.790
is also a member of the Power Gang?

11:26.620 --> 11:28.430
How has Daxi's martial world

11:29.220 --> 11:32.100
come to this?

11:34.520 --> 11:35.600
Tianzheng.

11:36.700 --> 11:41.150
All our lives, we've rivaled each other
in secret over martial arts.

11:41.860 --> 11:43.120
Who would have thought

11:43.740 --> 11:45.670
we'd leave this world together?

11:49.460 --> 11:51.030
Ascending to immortality.

11:52.460 --> 11:54.310
Reaching the Western paradise.

11:57.140 --> 12:03.570
Each following the Zen path
to our own destiny.

12:04.550 --> 12:05.480
Master. Master!

12:06.500 --> 12:06.980
Following the Zen path...

12:06.980 --> 12:07.910
Senior...

12:08.620 --> 12:11.700
To our own destiny.

12:16.540 --> 12:24.060
Amitabha.

12:40.340 --> 12:41.150
Master!

12:45.830 --> 12:47.950
Amitabha.

13:29.340 --> 13:31.620
Namo Amitabha. Namo Amitabha.

13:31.620 --> 13:33.910
Namo Amitabha. Namo Amitabha.

13:33.910 --> 13:35.310
What's exactly going on?

13:35.910 --> 13:37.840
It was Liu Suifeng of the Power Gang

13:38.020 --> 13:40.880
who schemed to kill
Masters Tianzheng and Taichan.

13:47.700 --> 13:48.410
Qiushui.

13:49.520 --> 13:50.210
Qiushui.

13:51.020 --> 13:52.280
Where are our parents?

13:55.670 --> 13:57.310
Tell me! What exactly happened?

13:57.310 --> 13:58.570
Where are our parents!

14:02.620 --> 14:03.670
Yiren.

14:05.100 --> 14:06.980
Feng Lang is Liu Suifeng.

14:10.070 --> 14:11.340
It's all my fault.

14:12.310 --> 14:13.910
I trusted him wrongly.

14:15.140 --> 14:17.000
I'm the one who harmed our parents

14:17.790 --> 14:19.790
and the Huanhua Sect!

14:21.750 --> 14:22.580
What?

14:24.950 --> 14:26.550
Isn't Feng Lang your friend?

14:27.620 --> 14:29.150
How could he be Liu Suifeng?

14:30.460 --> 14:31.820
I was blind.

14:32.500 --> 14:35.270
I was blind
and foolishly took a villain for a friend.

14:35.270 --> 14:37.470
I foolishly took a villain for a friend!

14:45.460 --> 14:48.460
What? What did you say!

15:04.270 --> 15:04.870
Enough!

15:06.790 --> 15:08.060
This is not what Qiushui wanted either.

15:08.060 --> 15:08.880
Get out of my way!

15:08.880 --> 15:09.510
Yiren!

15:09.980 --> 15:11.240
The affairs of the Xiao family

15:11.240 --> 15:13.500
are none of your business as an outsider!

15:16.950 --> 15:17.680
Big Brother!

15:19.190 --> 15:19.950
Big Brother!

15:21.390 --> 15:22.120
Big Brother!

15:22.680 --> 15:23.310
Big Brother!

15:23.310 --> 15:24.070
Qiushui.

15:25.310 --> 15:26.370
Why did you do that?

15:28.430 --> 15:29.120
Kaiyan.

15:32.550 --> 15:33.390
Ask him!

15:35.230 --> 15:37.390
Ask him why he invited the wolf
into our house

15:37.390 --> 15:39.820
and gave that villain Liu Suifeng a chance
to strike!

15:39.820 --> 15:41.150
He even befriended him,

15:41.520 --> 15:43.120
caused our parents' deaths,

15:43.790 --> 15:46.120
and brought our Xiao family to this state!

15:47.270 --> 15:48.030
What?

15:53.140 --> 15:54.470
Our parents' deaths...

15:56.100 --> 15:57.300
Our parents are dead?

16:03.390 --> 16:04.220
Qiushui.

16:05.790 --> 16:06.670
What exactly happened?

16:06.670 --> 16:07.740
Kaiyan.

16:08.500 --> 16:09.740
It's all my fault.

16:10.820 --> 16:12.670
It's all my fault.

16:15.460 --> 16:16.700
Tell me about it.

16:16.760 --> 16:18.170
Tell everyone!

16:18.270 --> 16:20.790
Speak! Why has it come to this?

16:21.000 --> 16:23.310
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

16:22.220 --> 16:23.550
Our parents are dead...

16:23.330 --> 16:28.040
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

16:24.150 --> 16:25.390
Y-Yiren.

16:26.500 --> 16:28.100
Where are Father and Mother?

16:28.300 --> 16:30.650
♪ The wind blows ♪

16:28.390 --> 16:29.150
Father!

16:30.430 --> 16:31.150
Mother!

16:30.680 --> 16:35.120
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

16:35.720 --> 16:38.170
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

16:38.190 --> 16:40.660
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

16:39.430 --> 16:42.190
I-Is the Xiao family

16:40.680 --> 16:43.790
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

16:42.910 --> 16:45.270
down to just us few now?

16:44.480 --> 16:51.770
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

16:46.440 --> 16:48.600
I wish you had died in Guangling!

16:49.980 --> 16:52.440
The Xiao family is all ruined
because of you!

16:52.670 --> 16:55.200
I, Xiao Yiren, no longer have you
as a brother.

16:55.790 --> 16:58.890
♪ Unspoken regret, shattered in the sand ♪

16:56.910 --> 17:00.550
From now on, you are no longer
part of the Xiao family!

16:59.020 --> 17:02.240
♪ Yesterday was a dream
difficult to find ♪

17:03.190 --> 17:06.470
♪ So far away in the blink of an eye ♪

17:05.829 --> 17:06.950
Why!

17:06.540 --> 17:09.530
♪ With weeds overgrown, where is home? ♪

17:08.390 --> 17:09.430
Where are our parents?

17:09.430 --> 17:10.460
Where are our parents?

17:10.460 --> 17:11.540
Where are they!

17:10.700 --> 17:13.900
♪ Owing love and hate;
favors and feuds rain down ♪

17:13.920 --> 17:17.660
♪ Too many apologies to be said ♪

17:17.670 --> 17:18.869
Why has it come to this?

17:18.099 --> 17:20.990
♪ Missed in the intersection of time ♪

17:21.670 --> 17:22.780
Liu Suifeng!

17:21.810 --> 17:24.050
♪ The inevitable destiny ♪

17:23.540 --> 17:24.910
Liu Suifeng!

17:24.560 --> 17:26.550
♪ The moon is reflected in the water ♪

17:26.569 --> 17:30.630
♪ Not even a ripple is left behind ♪

17:28.500 --> 17:29.260
Kaiyan!

17:32.290 --> 17:34.960
♪ The broken sword can't be pulled out ♪

17:33.500 --> 17:34.870
Yiren...

17:34.980 --> 17:38.450
♪ It's a heartbreaking punishment ♪

17:39.040 --> 17:41.600
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

17:41.620 --> 17:45.870
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

17:46.340 --> 17:48.790
♪ The wind blows ♪

17:48.810 --> 17:53.730
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

17:53.850 --> 17:56.090
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

17:56.260 --> 17:58.880
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

17:57.590 --> 17:58.460
Kaiyan...

17:58.900 --> 18:02.120
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

18:02.660 --> 18:09.000
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

18:02.910 --> 18:04.020
Yiren...

18:05.730 --> 18:06.830
Kaiyan...

18:09.370 --> 18:11.680
♪ Huanhua flower withers ♪

18:11.700 --> 18:16.410
♪ What's the meaning of my life? ♪

18:12.540 --> 18:13.590
Kaiyan...

18:16.670 --> 18:19.020
♪ The wind blows ♪

18:19.050 --> 18:23.490
♪ Like a farewell song ♪

18:19.500 --> 18:20.500
Yiren...

18:24.090 --> 18:26.540
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

18:26.560 --> 18:29.030
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

18:29.050 --> 18:32.160
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

18:30.980 --> 18:32.060
Yiren...

18:32.580 --> 18:39.860
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

18:35.780 --> 18:37.260
Yiren.

18:41.880 --> 18:44.160
Please don't leave me behind.

18:42.310 --> 18:44.550
♪ Who accompanies when the qin breaks? ♪

18:44.720 --> 18:47.340
♪ How much sadness is there? ♪

18:47.360 --> 18:50.580
♪ Gazing at the moon
at the end of the world ♪

18:50.020 --> 18:50.830
Yiren...

18:51.120 --> 18:57.460
♪ Tears fall unrestrained;
the leaves are unswayed ♪

18:52.110 --> 18:53.430
Kaiyan...

19:05.780 --> 19:07.180
Master, are you alright?

19:08.260 --> 19:10.190
Xiao Qiushui was really ruthless.

19:10.950 --> 19:13.410
Xiao Qiushui doesn't have
that ability yet.

19:14.190 --> 19:16.950
If he hadn't borrowed the internal energy
from the two Sect Leaders,

19:16.950 --> 19:18.350
he couldn't have hurt me.

19:20.660 --> 19:21.420
Move aside.

19:26.430 --> 19:28.030
I've heard so much about you.

19:28.300 --> 19:29.780
White Phoenix, you've been
keeping a low profile.

19:29.780 --> 19:30.610
I never expected

19:30.610 --> 19:31.460
that you're actually

19:30.800 --> 19:32.870
[White Phoenix, Power Gang]

19:31.460 --> 19:33.220
the White Guanyin of Hengshan Sect.

19:33.220 --> 19:34.060
Thanks a lot

19:35.260 --> 19:36.390
for your help today.

19:36.980 --> 19:38.440
If she had acted any later,

19:38.590 --> 19:40.190
you would have died, Master.

19:41.730 --> 19:44.060
If you want to thank someone,
thank Chief.

19:44.410 --> 19:46.300
If Chief didn't value you so much,

19:46.840 --> 19:48.490
I wouldn't have risked
exposing my identity

19:48.490 --> 19:49.250
to save you.

19:52.870 --> 19:53.980
The one you love,

19:54.720 --> 19:56.580
protect them with your own hands.

19:58.510 --> 19:59.190
What nonsense are you talking about?

19:59.190 --> 19:59.990
Song Mingzhu.

20:01.220 --> 20:03.800
I'll return to Hengshan Sect
to handle some matters first,

20:03.800 --> 20:05.260
and then go back to report.

20:10.950 --> 20:13.150
White Phoenix's whereabouts
have been exposed.

20:13.150 --> 20:15.020
Why does she still risk going back?

20:15.020 --> 20:17.220
Longhu repaid his debt to the Power Gang

20:17.540 --> 20:20.020
and took his own life to repay his master.

20:22.180 --> 20:24.710
I hope White Phoenix
won't be the next Longhu.

20:25.330 --> 20:27.530
Master, you don't trust White Phoenix?

20:28.140 --> 20:29.740
What I think doesn't matter.

20:33.870 --> 20:36.000
Now that the two Sect Leaders are dead,

20:36.020 --> 20:38.350
I've finally fulfilled Chief's command.

20:40.260 --> 20:43.520
It's just there's still no trace of
the Hero Command Token.

20:45.630 --> 20:46.760
Let's go back first.

20:47.110 --> 20:50.110
Xiao Xilou and Sun Huishan
still have secrets on them.

21:58.260 --> 21:59.060
How did it go?

21:59.950 --> 22:03.010
Liu Suifeng went to great lengths
but couldn't find it.

22:03.710 --> 22:08.040
It seems the Hero Command Token really
isn't in the Xiao family's possession.

22:08.130 --> 22:08.920
In that case,

22:09.160 --> 22:11.370
it must be in the hands of the Power Gang.

22:20.740 --> 22:22.200
In today's martial world,

22:22.670 --> 22:25.070
there are too many self-important people.

22:25.870 --> 22:27.550
It's time to let them know

22:28.220 --> 22:30.190
who the true dominator is.

22:32.740 --> 22:34.220
The more chaotic
the martial world is,

22:34.220 --> 22:35.880
the more interesting it gets.

22:36.420 --> 22:40.310
The real show is just beginning.

22:41.590 --> 22:44.590
The righteous sects and the Power Gang

22:44.590 --> 22:46.940
are already at daggers drawn
in the martial world.

22:46.940 --> 22:49.290
If we add fuel to the fire now,

22:50.020 --> 22:51.680
once both sides are weakened,

22:51.980 --> 22:54.180
I can reap the benefits like a fisherman

22:54.620 --> 22:56.530
and reshape the order
of the martial world.

22:54.670 --> 22:56.950
[Qu Jianchi]

22:57.160 --> 22:59.380
[Meng Xiangfeng; Qu Jianchi]
[Iron-Clad Constable; Tang Rou]

22:58.670 --> 23:02.110
Xiao Qiushui, seeing
the current state of affairs,

23:02.770 --> 23:05.960
would you be satisfied?

23:06.780 --> 23:09.090
[Heavenly King of Shaolin Sect]

23:09.600 --> 23:12.670
[Taichan of Wudang Sect]

23:32.650 --> 23:33.810
-Qiushui.
-Qiushui.

23:33.810 --> 23:34.430
Wake up.

23:34.430 --> 23:35.590
Qiushui.

23:35.910 --> 23:37.040
-Wake up.
-Qiushui?

23:37.390 --> 23:38.520
-Wake up.
-Qiushui!

23:38.830 --> 23:39.630
Qiushui?

23:39.630 --> 23:40.980
Wake up, Qiushui.

23:41.300 --> 23:42.190
-Come on, wake up.
-Wake up!

23:42.190 --> 23:43.020
Wake up now!

24:03.870 --> 24:04.580
Big Brother!

24:04.580 --> 24:05.310
Big Brother.

24:05.590 --> 24:07.450
Big Brother, how are you feeling?

24:07.630 --> 24:08.320
Qiushui.

24:08.630 --> 24:09.430
You're awake.

24:25.060 --> 24:26.020
Xiao Qiushui.

24:26.390 --> 24:28.220
I don't have you as my brother anymore!

24:28.220 --> 24:29.110
Xiao Qiushui.

24:29.300 --> 24:30.560
This is all your fault.

24:31.110 --> 24:31.700
Qiushui.

24:32.090 --> 24:33.950
You've disappointed me greatly.

24:38.630 --> 24:40.500
Qiushui, you're back.

24:41.580 --> 24:43.380
We've waited for you for so long.

24:44.350 --> 24:45.020
Qiushui.

24:49.830 --> 24:50.430
Qiushui.

24:56.810 --> 24:57.390
Big Brother!

24:57.390 --> 24:57.920
Qiushui!

24:58.220 --> 24:58.950
Big Brother!

24:59.350 --> 25:00.080
Big Brother!

25:00.740 --> 25:01.460
Qiushui!

25:01.460 --> 25:02.190
Big Brother!

25:03.950 --> 25:05.560
Big Brother, I'm Yuhan!

25:05.830 --> 25:06.700
Let them go!

25:07.190 --> 25:07.740
I'm Qiu!

25:07.740 --> 25:09.470
Big Brother, please calm down!

25:15.670 --> 25:16.840
Stop this, Qiushui!

25:20.160 --> 25:21.820
Liu Suifeng of the Power Gang!

25:21.830 --> 25:23.500
I'm going to kill you!

25:28.380 --> 25:30.020
Big Brother, I'm Yuhan.

25:30.400 --> 25:31.750
Calm down, Qiushui!

25:31.780 --> 25:34.060
You want to strangle me to death?

25:39.990 --> 25:40.670
Qiushui!

25:41.830 --> 25:43.260
See clearly who they are!

25:44.260 --> 25:44.920
Brother...

25:53.810 --> 25:55.260
Big Brother, calm down.

25:57.460 --> 25:58.060
Qiushui.

26:01.170 --> 26:02.570
-Big Brother!
-Qiushui!

26:25.460 --> 26:26.190
Big Brother.

26:26.460 --> 26:28.520
You're seriously injured right now.

26:28.610 --> 26:30.470
You must not rush to seek revenge.

26:30.700 --> 26:33.760
Absolutely do not lose your temper again,
Big Brother.

26:50.150 --> 26:51.280
Where are you going?

26:53.220 --> 26:54.390
I want to take a walk

26:56.100 --> 26:56.970
outside alone.

26:56.590 --> 26:59.010
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

26:59.870 --> 27:02.640
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

27:04.260 --> 27:07.420
♪ Past events linger
in the corner of my eye ♪

27:07.770 --> 27:12.170
♪ First meetings, then farewells ♪

27:13.020 --> 27:16.420
♪ How many layers in heaven and earth ♪

27:16.800 --> 27:20.170
♪ The mortal world is always the same ♪

27:21.100 --> 27:23.920
♪ Clouds and mountains
stretch west and east ♪

27:23.950 --> 27:28.640
♪ Chivalry dwells in the heart ♪

27:28.700 --> 27:30.700
♪ In the mortal world,
nothing lasts forever ♪

27:30.720 --> 27:32.720
♪ A few words, laughter shared ♪

27:32.920 --> 27:35.660
♪ Swords and books,
the thrill of the blade ♪

27:36.140 --> 27:38.360
♪ Parting under thousands of miles
of wind, rain, and snow ♪

27:38.380 --> 27:43.730
♪ Embarking on the long road,
freely at ease ♪

27:44.520 --> 27:46.590
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

27:46.610 --> 27:48.610
♪ Several tides rise and fall ♪

27:48.640 --> 27:51.770
♪ Singing of the present while drunk ♪

27:51.980 --> 27:54.290
♪ Raising my head
to finish this cup of wine ♪

27:54.350 --> 27:58.450
♪ All grudges in the martial world
vanish in a stroke ♪

28:36.450 --> 28:38.870
♪ Stars and moon brush my face ♪

28:39.730 --> 28:42.500
♪ The journey of life
spreads out like a long scroll ♪

28:44.120 --> 28:47.280
