29:42.290 --> 29:44.290
♪ A few wild howls ♪

29:44.460 --> 29:47.520
♪ Come and go like flying birds ♪

29:47.940 --> 29:50.030
♪ Having witnessed countless miles
of sorrow and joy ♪

29:50.050 --> 29:55.150
♪  I've naturally gained courage
to be a hero ♪

29:56.350 --> 29:58.260
♪ Life in the world doesn't stop
with mere passing ♪

29:58.280 --> 30:00.420
♪ Several rounds of turmoil ♪

30:00.440 --> 30:03.410
♪ Swaying in life-and-death dreams ♪

30:02.350 --> 30:03.960
[Huanhua Sect]

30:04.050 --> 30:06.050
♪ Shadows under countless lamps
over a thousand lifetimes ♪

30:06.070 --> 30:10.910
♪ Each leaves a single light
to shine through this night ♪

30:12.430 --> 30:14.430
♪ Smoke drifts, the road stretches far ♪

30:14.460 --> 30:16.430
♪ Love fades, people grow distant ♪

30:16.480 --> 30:18.480
♪ Flowers fall as dawn approaches ♪

30:18.510 --> 30:23.720
♪ Heart like fine rain,
drifting with the clouds ♪

30:22.670 --> 30:25.020
The last time
the three of us brothers gathered

30:25.020 --> 30:26.260
was several months ago.

30:26.260 --> 30:28.660
-Yes.
-We shall not part until drunk today.

30:28.700 --> 30:30.100
You should thank Kaiyan.

30:30.190 --> 30:31.720
He specially prepared this

30:31.740 --> 30:33.700
so we brothers could have
a proper gathering today.

30:33.700 --> 30:35.390
Let's drink to our heart's content.

30:35.390 --> 30:37.430
Qiushui, why aren't you drinking?

30:39.700 --> 30:40.430
I'm about to.

30:43.980 --> 30:45.630
Aren't you always out

30:45.630 --> 30:46.780
drinking and womanizing?

30:46.780 --> 30:48.890
How come you're not
drinking with us today?

30:48.890 --> 30:51.220
How do you usually drink
at Qunfang House?

30:51.520 --> 30:53.400
Well, my b... My butt...

30:53.430 --> 30:54.190
Your butt.

30:54.390 --> 30:55.720
You think I didn't hear?

30:55.740 --> 30:58.200
Mother prepared leather underwear for you.

30:59.830 --> 31:01.760
Well... I didn't wear them anyway.

31:03.020 --> 31:04.780
Come on, have a drink and you'll be fine.

31:04.780 --> 31:05.980
Alcohol disinfects.

31:05.980 --> 31:06.640
Bottoms up!

31:06.780 --> 31:07.980
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

31:09.350 --> 31:10.950
Xiao Yiren, the dignified

31:11.540 --> 31:14.000
and ambitious eldest son
of the Xiao family.

31:14.020 --> 31:16.150
Xiao Kaiyan, steady and silent,

31:16.630 --> 31:18.220
the solid pillar of Huanhua Sect.

31:18.220 --> 31:18.870
Drink up.

31:24.460 --> 31:26.540
Yiren, Qiushui, try this.

31:27.300 --> 31:29.360
I hunted this wild boar in Guangling.

31:30.110 --> 31:32.150
These boars roam all over the mountains,

31:32.150 --> 31:34.210
and their meat is excellent. Come on.

31:35.190 --> 31:35.630
Here.

31:36.910 --> 31:38.720
Qiushui, try this.

31:38.980 --> 31:41.980
This was specially caught
from the open sea by Kaiyan.

31:43.910 --> 31:45.350
Thank you, Yiren, Kaiyan.

31:45.350 --> 31:45.700
Here.

31:47.700 --> 31:48.060
Here.

31:49.350 --> 31:50.780
By the way, Yiren, Kaiyan.

31:50.780 --> 31:52.700
I spoke recklessly before

31:53.060 --> 31:54.540
and offended you both more than once.

31:54.540 --> 31:57.830
Let me offer you this cup of wine
as an apology.

31:59.630 --> 32:03.060
Yiren, Qiushui's acting
so differently today.

32:03.500 --> 32:05.460
It feels quite strange.

32:06.670 --> 32:08.630
Well, he's willing to take the punishment.

32:08.630 --> 32:10.390
Come on, cheers. Bottoms up.

32:15.060 --> 32:16.590
That's the spirit! Come on.

32:16.740 --> 32:17.220
Cheers!

32:18.430 --> 32:18.960
Alright!

32:20.850 --> 32:22.010
Come on! Cheers!

32:22.630 --> 32:23.760
Come on, bottoms up!

32:23.920 --> 32:24.910
-Cheers!
-Cheers!

32:24.910 --> 32:26.220
Qiushui, why are you cheating again?

32:26.220 --> 32:27.080
Yiren, Kaiyan.

32:28.870 --> 32:29.740
Yiren...

32:35.350 --> 32:36.150
Kaiyan...

35:09.180 --> 35:09.910
Qiushui.

35:32.540 --> 35:33.210
Xueyu.

35:40.920 --> 35:45.440
All the way here,
I've been praying to heaven

35:46.510 --> 35:48.240
to protect our Xiao family.

35:54.700 --> 35:56.220
But I still came too late.

36:03.970 --> 36:05.660
I've failed our parents.

36:07.180 --> 36:07.910
Xueyu.

36:09.870 --> 36:10.980
Don't say that.

36:13.160 --> 36:14.550
It's all my fault.

36:25.540 --> 36:26.310
Qiushui.

36:28.760 --> 36:31.420
Since your martial arts
were crippled earlier,

36:32.310 --> 36:33.180
I imagine

36:35.540 --> 36:37.140
the meridians in your body

36:38.280 --> 36:39.940
must now be in complete chaos.

36:41.580 --> 36:43.180
You should be extra careful.

36:44.610 --> 36:45.290
I will.

36:53.630 --> 36:54.870
The bodies of

36:55.280 --> 36:56.890
Masters Tianzheng and Taichan...

36:56.890 --> 36:58.030
The bodies of the two masters

36:58.030 --> 37:00.090
were taken back to the Central Plains

37:00.220 --> 37:01.750
by their disciples yesterday.

37:01.750 --> 37:02.950
What about Uncle Qu?

37:03.390 --> 37:05.910
The Qu sisters were too grief-stricken.

37:06.540 --> 37:08.660
They're now resting at the inn

37:08.660 --> 37:09.860
with Uncle Qu's body.

37:17.590 --> 37:20.050
They all died trying to help
our Xiao family.

37:22.200 --> 37:24.530
I should have been the one
to send them off.

37:24.890 --> 37:25.620
Big Brother.

37:26.350 --> 37:27.080
Don't worry.

37:27.660 --> 37:29.660
Leave the Qu family's matters to me.

37:31.100 --> 37:31.910
Qiu.

37:34.320 --> 37:36.450
Then I'll trouble you to make the trip.

37:42.980 --> 37:43.750
Big Brother.

37:45.390 --> 37:46.580
After Yiren left,

37:47.460 --> 37:49.390
he arranged for the mortuary downhill
to come and collect the bodies.

37:49.390 --> 37:51.350
But the mortuary

37:51.750 --> 37:53.680
fears the Power Gang might return,

37:53.870 --> 37:57.460
so they won't come up to collect
the bodies until two days later.

37:57.790 --> 37:58.990
The weather is so hot.

38:00.580 --> 38:02.750
We absolutely cannot delay
for another two days.

38:02.750 --> 38:04.950
They died fighting for the Xiao family.

38:06.750 --> 38:08.810
If I can't see to their proper burial,

38:10.870 --> 38:12.870
how could I possibly sleep at night?

38:16.100 --> 38:16.830
Qiushui.

38:18.430 --> 38:19.880
We'll be with you.

39:20.620 --> 39:22.830
Father, Mother.

39:23.950 --> 39:25.060
I don't know

39:27.430 --> 39:29.710
if I still deserve to call you that now.

39:30.460 --> 39:32.250
[In Memory of Late Mother, Sun Huishan]

39:32.270 --> 39:34.410
[In Memory of Late Father, Xiao Xilou]

39:33.140 --> 39:34.040
Because

39:35.620 --> 39:37.460
I'm not really Xiao Qiushui.

39:41.580 --> 39:43.390
Your son Xiao Qiushui

39:46.750 --> 39:49.540
was a true hero in the martial world.

39:51.140 --> 39:53.580
I've fantasized countless times

39:54.810 --> 39:57.940
about becoming the protagonist
in martial arts novels.

40:00.310 --> 40:01.970
But when the time really came,

40:03.350 --> 40:05.950
I realized that I'm not worthy at all.

40:09.350 --> 40:10.180
Mother,

40:11.420 --> 40:12.460
you know what?

40:13.230 --> 40:15.540
When I suddenly entered this world,

40:16.530 --> 40:21.700
I thought I could save the entire world.

40:27.910 --> 40:29.790
I thought I was so clever.

40:31.020 --> 40:32.380
With my foreknowledge of

40:32.380 --> 40:34.460
all those plots from the novel,

40:36.310 --> 40:38.830
I thought I could change everyone's fate.

40:40.750 --> 40:41.790
But in the end,

40:44.060 --> 40:46.620
I realized I couldn't change anything.

40:49.140 --> 40:51.500
It was all my own arrogance.

40:52.660 --> 40:54.230
I was truly too proud

40:55.460 --> 40:56.870
and too conceited.

41:02.460 --> 41:03.430
Now,

41:04.910 --> 41:08.020
I've made everything turn out
even worse than it would have.

41:08.020 --> 41:09.390
The real Xiao Qiushui

41:10.980 --> 41:13.430
wouldn't have had
his martial skills crippled

41:13.430 --> 41:15.230
and his tendons severed.

41:15.830 --> 41:17.180
If he were here,

41:17.980 --> 41:19.910
he might even have gotten revenge.

41:21.140 --> 41:22.060
But now,

41:22.980 --> 41:25.110
I've dragged Xiao Qiushui down with me

41:26.520 --> 41:28.560
and lost completely and utterly.
